WEBVTT

00:00:28.412 --> 00:00:30.811
one of the most infallible tools

00:00:30.835 --> 00:00:35.403
to fight for the nutritional,

00:00:35.427 --> 00:00:37.980
emotional and environmental
well-being of our planet.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.337
Where at home?

00:00:40.344 --> 00:00:41.740
Well, in the kitchen.

00:00:43.026 --> 00:00:45.436
I'll tell you why with three stories.

00:00:46.356 --> 00:00:47.703
The first one:

00:00:47.727 --> 00:00:48.939
I'm from Lima,

00:00:48.963 --> 00:00:51.579
a product of mixed bloods, as you can see:

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:57.349
my mother, a daughter of the coastal area,
aristocratic and viceregal,

00:00:57.373 --> 00:01:00.296
and my father, a son of the Andes,
the Incas, from Cuzco.